WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
A battle in Guru Gobind Singh's time.

2
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.490
Wounded soldiers lie on both sides.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.000
One Sikh, Bhai Ghanaiya, moves
among them carrying water.

4
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.980
He gives water to the
wounded on his own side.

5
00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:15.820
Then he gives water to the enemy too.

6
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.240
Later, he was questioned about it.

7
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:23.120
Why would a Sikh carry water to the
very soldiers his own side was fighting?

8
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.600
In this mission, you'll meet
three kinds of Sikh service:

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.450
physical, mental and material.

10
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.930
Then you'll find out
where this service began,

11
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.450
with the very first free kitchen.

12
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.170
Your mission: find out how Bhai
Ghanaiya explained himself,

13
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.970
and why it matters to Sikhs.
